OL,3,GNEWSAPlayers threatened, official
OL,4,Aheadbutted and 72 red cards in week of
OL,5,Ayouth football
OL,6,
OL,7,FA youth football league has said
OL,8,Fbehaviour at matches hit an "all-time
OL,9,Flow" in just one week when young
OL,10,Fplayers were threatened, an official
OL,11,Fwas headbutted in front of children and
OL,12,Fpolice were called over possible hate
OL,13,Fspeech.
OL,15,FIn an email to team managers seen by
OL,16,Fthe BBC, the Central Scotland Football
OL,17,FAssociation said it had accrued a "long
OL,18,Flist" of discipline issues "which have
OL,19,Fno place in grassroots football".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
