OL,3,GNEWSAPlayers threatened, official
OL,4,Aheadbutted and 72 red cards in week of
OL,5,Ayouth football
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis included an incident at a football
OL,8,Ffestival where a team official
OL,9,Fheadbutted another team official in
OL,10,Ffront of children "who will be five and
OL,11,Fsix-years old".
OL,13,FThe league also heard of discriminatory
OL,14,Flanguage and matches being abandoned in
OL,15,Fthe week where 72 red cards were handed
OL,16,Fout.
